20. SECURITY ARCHITECTURE
==========================================================

FutureSchool is intended to become a multi-school SaaS application.

The final production system must enforce security on the backend.

Frontend visibility is NOT security.

Conceptual request authorization:

Authenticated User
        ↓
School
        ↓
Role
        ↓
Permission
        ↓
Relationship / Resource Scope
        ↓
Business Rule
        ↓
ALLOW / DENY

Example:

Maths Teacher
Class 10-A

Can enter:
10-A Maths ✅

Cannot enter:
10-A Physics ❌
9-B Maths ❌

A School A user must never access School B records.

